  Mult_Class_2_Pod_1 Fan Coil Heat Coil, !- Heating Coil Name
  AUTOSIZE,                  !- Maximum Hot Water Flow Rate
  0,                         !- Minimum Hot Water Flow Rate
  0.001;                     !- Heating Convergence Tolerance

